{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Mini Weather 是一款極簡風格的天氣預報 App，適合喜歡安靜、無廣告介面的用家。它把即時天氣直接放在主畫面與鎖定畫面，並提供與昨日比較的冷暖差異、空氣質素與日出日落等資訊。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>十二款主畫面天氣小工具</h2>\n<p>內建十二款以上主畫面與鎖定畫面小工具，涵蓋天氣摘要、每日預報、溫度對比、降水、日出日落、空氣質素與風向羅盤等。早上、中午、傍晚與夜間預報均附與昨日比較的溫度差異，另設十款配合天空變化的動態背景。用家可自選玻璃背景、字體與攝氏華氏單位，支援離線查看快取天氣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-649-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-650-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-651-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-652-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-653-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-654-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mini Weather: Cold or Warm</li>\n<li>應用類別：Weather</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T10:58:39.056478+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}